  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.8: FR0029's FS3511 shrink advice becomes four automatic fixes — leading plain lets hoist above the builder, an if/else body splits into per-arm tasks (one awaiting arm suffices; comments travel via line-region arm cuts), a non-awaiting tail wraps into a local function inside the CE (closures capture the locals: no parameters, no annotations), and an awaiting try/finally suffix becomes its own task-returning function consumed with return!. FR0049 rewrites blocking binds across the matrix — GetAwaiter().GetResult(), .Result, and single-arg Async.RunSynchronously all become let! in task and async builders, with Async.AwaitTask applied where needed; the toward-sync sibling swap is opt-in only ({\"FR0049\": {\"syncSwap\": 1}}). New FR0117 folds adjacent same-result match arms into one or-pattern arm — contiguous runs only, order untouched — composing with FR0112's chain-to-match.",
